    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## fn_filter_articles()\n\nAccepts a list of articles and returns only those deemed relevant by `fn_filter_article()`.\n\n**Per article (loop):**\n1. `fn_filter_article()` scores relevance via embedding similarity + optional LLM fallback\n2. Result is fed back into the loop with `isRelevant` set\n\n**After all articles are processed:**\n3. `Filter: Keep Relevant` keeps only `isRelevant = true`\n\nThe caller receives a clean list of relevant articles only.",
